  "reasoning": "The defendant used a tractor to plow forest land without any permits, destroying seedlings and converting the forest area to soybean fields. This constitutes illegal occupation and destruction of forest resources. Under the Criminal Law, such conduct is charged as the crime of destroying forest resources (破坏森林资源罪). No other crimes are indicated by the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]破坏森林资源罪<eoa>"
}
